WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:04.899
You know...

00:04.900 --> 00:08.999
it would be easy if we could
question the mastermind behind all this.

00:09.000 --> 00:10.909
Mastermind...?

00:10.910 --> 00:13.009
You're referring to that girl, right?

00:13.010 --> 00:17.409
The girl you met in the
white room, right Yuzuki?

00:17.410 --> 00:20.079
But, to get there...

00:20.080 --> 00:23.249
someone needs to become an LRIG.

00:23.250 --> 00:25.089
We're not going that route!

00:25.090 --> 00:26.789
Let's think of another way.

00:26.790 --> 00:27.920
Yup...

00:43.040 --> 00:45.969
I... have no wish...

00:45.970 --> 00:49.309
I have a wish now.

00:49.310 --> 00:53.649
I want to release her
from the card. My friends...

00:53.650 --> 00:55.219
My precious friends...!

00:55.220 --> 00:57.319
You want to meet Tama, right?

00:57.320 --> 01:02.120
If you battle again, there's
no telling what would happen.

00:57.320 --> 00:59.219
That wish may come true...

00:59.220 --> 01:02.119
Something worse may happen next!

01:02.120 --> 01:05.259
The Selector battles are full of lies...

01:05.260 --> 01:09.959
There could be more behind all this...
I need to be careful with my wish...

01:09.960 --> 01:11.960
But, then...

01:14.140 --> 01:17.110
I won't be able to move, and...

01:35.620 --> 01:38.650
It's all because of that
strange voice of yours.

02:01.650 --> 02:03.149
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

02:03.150 --> 02:07.159
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

02:07.160 --> 02:09.859
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

02:09.860 --> 02:12.729
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

02:12.730 --> 02:14.029
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

02:14.030 --> 02:18.229
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

02:18.230 --> 02:23.299
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

02:23.300 --> 02:27.709
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

02:27.710 --> 02:30.349
<i>you're there</i>

02:30.350 --> 02:33.149
<i>with a smile</i>

02:33.150 --> 02:38.649
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

02:38.650 --> 02:42.090
<i>And still</i>

02:43.730 --> 02:46.929
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

02:46.930 --> 02:51.229
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

02:51.230 --> 02:53.669
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

02:53.670 --> 02:55.339
<i>Now cross</i>

02:55.340 --> 02:58.009
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:58.010 --> 03:05.079
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

03:05.080 --> 03:11.580
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

03:14.460 --> 03:17.389
Say, Ru-<i>chan</i>? How about a game of WIXOSS?

03:17.390 --> 03:18.190
Huh?

03:18.191 --> 03:21.559
Grandma made a new deck.

03:21.560 --> 03:23.690
So, how about it?

03:25.030 --> 03:27.470
Sure, okay!

03:28.800 --> 03:31.469
I didn't know that kind of
LRIG card was released...

03:31.470 --> 03:34.209
Wow, the effect is pretty neat!

03:34.210 --> 03:37.809
Ru-<i>chan</i>, your LRIG was Tama-<i>chan</i>, right?

03:37.810 --> 03:39.479
Huh?!

03:39.480 --> 03:41.479
T-Tama is...

03:41.480 --> 03:44.980
I'm... actually trying a new deck out.

03:46.720 --> 03:49.119
Let me try this LRIG.

03:49.120 --> 03:51.489
Why aren't you using me?

03:51.490 --> 03:56.459
This isn't a battle between Selectors,
so there shouldn't be any problems.

03:56.460 --> 04:02.069
Well, since we don't have any tangerines,
what penalty should we play on today?

04:02.070 --> 04:03.839
How about grocery
shopping for tonight's dinner?

04:03.840 --> 04:06.409
Okay, let's go with that!

04:06.410 --> 04:08.739
So, disregarding me?

04:08.740 --> 04:12.110
There's no way you can
disregard me forever...

04:13.150 --> 04:16.149
My wish will come true...

04:16.150 --> 04:20.950
Yes. She's here... in this world.

04:25.930 --> 04:29.990
Say, you're that model, Akira, right?

04:31.000 --> 04:34.769
I knew it! Wow, you're so cute!

04:34.770 --> 04:38.609
You appeared in <i>Men's
Lon-Lon</i> as a model before, and...

04:38.610 --> 04:40.700
Shut it, twerp.

04:45.180 --> 04:47.379
Kept you waiting there, Akira.

04:47.380 --> 04:50.150
Huh? I-Iona...?

04:52.650 --> 04:56.989
Don't be spouting that crap's
name with that crap voice of yours!

04:56.990 --> 04:58.989
Not against my Urith...

04:58.990 --> 05:01.360
U-Urith...?

05:05.500 --> 05:07.339
Akira...

05:07.340 --> 05:10.409
You promised not to
say that name in public.

05:10.410 --> 05:13.030
I... I'm sorry...

05:15.180 --> 05:17.509
You didn't put makeup on today?

05:17.510 --> 05:18.649
Yup.

05:18.650 --> 05:21.980
I wanted you to praise me, Urith...

05:23.650 --> 05:26.089
It's so beautiful...

05:26.090 --> 05:29.889
Because of Urith, I...

05:29.890 --> 05:33.059
was finally able to change.

05:33.060 --> 05:34.659
Akira, you have a guest.

05:34.660 --> 05:36.329
Shut up, old hag!

05:36.330 --> 05:39.699
Don't bother me, and get
whoever that is out of here!

05:39.700 --> 05:42.069
If you want me to be in the public eye,

05:42.070 --> 05:45.169
bring me the money
I need to get this face fixed!

05:45.170 --> 05:46.909
Akira! Why you...!

05:46.910 --> 05:48.909
Missus? Let me...

05:48.910 --> 05:50.379
Well, but...

05:50.380 --> 05:51.940
The editor...?

05:56.050 --> 05:57.610
Akira!

06:01.760 --> 06:05.029
We came for you, Akira.

06:05.030 --> 06:07.190
Don't worry.

06:09.700 --> 06:11.129
What?!

06:11.130 --> 06:13.629
You don't need me anymore, right?!

06:13.630 --> 06:16.199
Like, there's no way you'd need me anymore!

06:16.200 --> 06:18.609
Look at this!

06:18.610 --> 06:21.979
This is a request by a certain someone.

06:21.980 --> 06:24.049
Certain someone...?

06:24.050 --> 06:28.479
Back then, I closed my
heart from everything.

06:28.480 --> 06:32.489
But, for some reason...
it was as if I was guided...

06:32.490 --> 06:34.719
Akira, over here.

06:34.720 --> 06:36.120
Go in.

06:40.800 --> 06:42.230
And...

06:46.730 --> 06:49.799
See? Looking good as ever, Akira!

06:49.800 --> 06:52.740
Like, you've got that sexy edge on you now!

06:54.810 --> 06:56.680
Let me get someone.

07:07.490 --> 07:09.019
Iona...

07:09.020 --> 07:10.959
You...

07:10.960 --> 07:12.929
So is that it?!

07:12.930 --> 07:16.499
You set this up to get some
laughs seeing me like this!

07:16.500 --> 07:17.300
No!

07:17.301 --> 07:18.999
Then what's this about?!

07:19.000 --> 07:23.170
Making a fool out of me?!
I'm gonna scar your face just like mine!

07:26.470 --> 07:28.179
Go ahead.

07:28.180 --> 07:30.809
Please scar me...

07:30.810 --> 07:36.340
If that's what it takes... to
mend your scarred heart.

07:38.820 --> 07:40.519
Y-You...

07:40.520 --> 07:43.320
You're not Iona.

07:44.560 --> 07:46.729
Urith.

07:46.730 --> 07:48.320
Urith?

07:49.860 --> 07:52.660
That damn, stuck up LRIG...?

07:53.730 --> 07:57.000
Iona... isn't here anymore.

07:59.070 --> 08:02.639
I was told by Urith...

08:02.640 --> 08:05.349
The rules governing
the world of Selectors...

08:05.350 --> 08:09.080
and that Iona's wish came true.

08:14.820 --> 08:15.859
That's messed up!

08:15.860 --> 08:21.560
So, regardless of my wish, Iona wanted
to quit being a human all this time?!

08:22.660 --> 08:24.330
Lame...

08:25.400 --> 08:27.169
Akira.

08:27.170 --> 08:31.069
There's no need for me to hide this...!

08:31.070 --> 08:37.179
If... If only she wasn't around, then I...!

08:37.180 --> 08:39.940
You're beautiful, Akira.

08:42.580 --> 08:45.789
I've always longed for you...

08:45.790 --> 08:47.619
Even when I was Iona's LRIG...

08:47.620 --> 08:50.789
Lemme go! After all that
crap you said about me!

08:50.790 --> 08:52.189
Screw you!

08:52.190 --> 08:55.130
I wanted you to rouse yourself!

08:56.730 --> 08:58.129
What...?

08:58.130 --> 09:02.799
The negative emotions you
bore made you a better person.

09:02.800 --> 09:09.409
I wanted you to let loose...
your inner emotions...

09:09.410 --> 09:12.809
Your beauty is one that
can't be tainted by anyone.

09:12.810 --> 09:15.649
Neither by Iona, or by WIXOSS...

09:15.650 --> 09:19.789
That scar is proof of your passion.

09:19.790 --> 09:23.720
It's more beautiful and
precious than all there is...

09:29.330 --> 09:30.399
Dammit!

09:30.400 --> 09:31.630
Akira!

09:35.970 --> 09:40.609
Even after, Urith kept her eyes on me...

09:40.610 --> 09:44.809
Old hag! How many times do I have
to tell you to say that you're coming in?!

09:44.810 --> 09:47.349
This box was addressed to you.

09:47.350 --> 09:48.580
Huh?

09:51.450 --> 09:53.420
"Urazoe Iona"

09:59.260 --> 10:03.990
This... A makeup kit...?

10:09.540 --> 10:12.639
Hey, Akira!

10:12.640 --> 10:15.309
Akira, we wanted to see you!

10:15.310 --> 10:15.980
Huh?

10:15.981 --> 10:17.809
You were out for so long!

10:17.810 --> 10:21.519
Why didn't you e-mail us?
We missed you!

10:21.520 --> 10:27.789
It was a lot easier than
expected, going out again...

10:27.790 --> 10:30.359
Not only that...

10:30.360 --> 10:32.559
Huh? A commercial?

10:32.560 --> 10:37.369
Iona asked for you,
Akira-<i>san,</i> to appear with her.

10:37.370 --> 10:38.800
Iona...

10:50.650 --> 10:52.649
What are you up to...?

10:52.650 --> 10:53.709
Akira!

10:53.710 --> 10:55.550
Here, come in!

10:59.490 --> 11:02.319
Thank you for coming.

11:02.320 --> 11:04.320
I'm so happy!

11:09.100 --> 11:11.329
I hated...

11:11.330 --> 11:13.699
I hated Iona...

11:13.700 --> 11:15.239
Akira...

11:15.240 --> 11:18.069
I'm not smart, and I'm poor...

11:18.070 --> 11:20.909
But, I had confidence in my looks.

11:20.910 --> 11:25.209
I was always the center of
attention, even as a model...

11:25.210 --> 11:28.179
But, ever since Iona appeared...

11:28.180 --> 11:34.219
no matter how I dress, or how
I pose, all everyone sees is Iona.

11:34.220 --> 11:37.629
I was just a foil for Iona...

11:37.630 --> 11:42.399
I was so frustrated...
No one was looking at me...

11:42.400 --> 11:44.199
The 2012...

11:44.200 --> 11:46.269
"Valentine's Day Special" edition page.

11:46.270 --> 11:49.469
Add 20% More Makeup To Your Eyes
Without Being Busted By Your Teacher;

11:49.470 --> 11:51.369
Natural Makeup Lessons.

11:51.370 --> 11:53.739
That was your first appearance.

11:53.740 --> 11:58.049
Next is the 2012 "Summer
Of Excitement" edition.

11:58.050 --> 12:00.079
In the article featuring
personal belongings, you...

12:00.080 --> 12:02.749
Wait! Why...?!

12:02.750 --> 12:06.150
Didn't I tell you that I
always admired you?

12:07.290 --> 12:11.659
Is that stalkerish?
Does that make you feel weird?

12:11.660 --> 12:14.799
But... these are my true feelings.

12:14.800 --> 12:22.800
As Urazoe Iona, I'll use all her wealth and
connections to make your wishes come true.

12:23.740 --> 12:27.239
To have more people look upon you.

12:27.240 --> 12:31.479
To get to a level not even
Iona could have achieved.

12:31.480 --> 12:32.579
And...

12:32.580 --> 12:37.179
I want to... see you shine in brilliance...

12:37.180 --> 12:38.850
forever.

12:40.290 --> 12:42.659
Urith...

12:42.660 --> 12:47.429
I had someone who loved me this much...

12:47.430 --> 12:53.099
Yes... I didn't know that
love could make me so strong.

12:53.100 --> 12:58.009
You got rid of the bad
Aki-lucky inside of me, Urith.

12:58.010 --> 13:03.279
Aki-lucky is now Aki-lovely
because of you, Urith.

13:03.280 --> 13:04.949
Aki-lovely...?

13:04.950 --> 13:08.549
Yup, lovely...

13:08.550 --> 13:09.880
Urith...?

13:13.150 --> 13:14.389
Is that it?

13:14.390 --> 13:15.889
Huh?

13:15.890 --> 13:19.159
Did the hatred you have
towards Iona disappear already?

13:19.160 --> 13:21.659
Was that all there was to your passion?

13:21.660 --> 13:24.059
N-No, that's not what I meant...

13:24.060 --> 13:28.630
But, if you'll love me,
Urith, then I don't...

13:29.700 --> 13:31.139
Didn't I tell you?

13:31.140 --> 13:34.069
The negative emotions you
bore made you a better person.

13:34.070 --> 13:39.670
That's the very reason why I
shower you freely with my love...

13:41.750 --> 13:45.719
Akira, can you...

13:45.720 --> 13:46.910
listen to my request?

13:53.360 --> 13:57.160
Um... Carrots... Potatoes...

13:54.600 --> 13:55.730
"Carrots"

13:54.600 --> 13:55.730
"Onions"

13:54.600 --> 13:56.860
"Curry"

13:55.731 --> 13:56.860
"Potatoes"

13:55.731 --> 13:56.860
"Chicken"

13:57.160 --> 14:00.499
Ah, and that's two bags of
potatoes with five in each.

14:00.500 --> 14:05.409
Aww... That's mean, Grandma!
Why make so much curry now?

14:05.410 --> 14:10.780
Oh? It wouldn't be much of a
penalty if the shopping load was light.

14:15.620 --> 14:16.580
Hello, Kominato...

14:16.581 --> 14:17.949
Ruko, did you see it?!

14:17.950 --> 14:19.889
Huh? Yuzuki?

14:19.890 --> 14:22.889
It was Akira! She appeared in
this month's <i>Ron-Ron</i> magazine!

14:22.890 --> 14:24.189
Akira-<i>san</i>?

14:24.190 --> 14:27.089
Yeah. Her scar's gone, too!

14:27.090 --> 14:29.629
I wonder if she became a Selector again...

14:29.630 --> 14:31.929
And then maybe her wish came true...

14:31.930 --> 14:34.969
I see... That's good to hear...

14:34.970 --> 14:36.769
It isn't good at all!

14:36.770 --> 14:38.069
Huh?!

14:38.070 --> 14:43.740
Well, it looks like Akira-<i>san</i>
is looking for Selectors again.

14:39.910 --> 14:43.410
- "WIXOSS-This ruuules! I'm personally hooked
again ♪" - "I wonder if there are any skilled

14:39.910 --> 14:43.410
players who will face me, nyaah ♪"

14:43.740 --> 14:45.449
Selectors?

14:45.450 --> 14:49.079
Um, well... now's not...

14:49.080 --> 14:53.249
Let's meet tomorrow. Okay... See you...

14:53.250 --> 14:54.419
Yuzuki-<i>chan</i>?

14:54.420 --> 14:59.260
Huh? Yup. Well, I'll go shopping now.

15:09.070 --> 15:12.075
Your "happy" is gonna run
away with that long face of yours!

15:10.640 --> 15:12.240
"Smooth Souvenir"

15:12.076 --> 15:13.840
"Super Moisture Facial Lotion"

15:12.241 --> 15:13.840
"On sale in March!"

15:15.080 --> 15:16.439
Iona-<i>san</i>...?

15:16.440 --> 15:18.170
That was Urith.

15:19.850 --> 15:21.079
Iona...

15:21.080 --> 15:23.679
Urith is an Eternal Girl.

15:23.680 --> 15:27.759
She has a mission to fulfill, for my wish.

15:27.760 --> 15:29.619
Iona's wish?

15:29.620 --> 15:32.959
Wasn't it to be my LRIG?

15:32.960 --> 15:34.959
That's only part of it.

15:34.960 --> 15:38.799
My wish is to become an
LRIG to a skilled Selector, and...

15:38.800 --> 15:41.539
to find another skilled Selector...

15:41.540 --> 15:43.299
to battle.

15:43.300 --> 15:44.539
Huh?

15:44.540 --> 15:45.969
Akira-<i>san...</i>

15:45.970 --> 15:49.779
It's been a while, Ru-ru...

15:49.780 --> 15:51.800
You, too, Iona...

15:59.390 --> 16:00.849
Battle...?!

16:00.850 --> 16:02.620
"Do Not Enter"

16:04.630 --> 16:09.329
Yup! I got another deck.

16:09.330 --> 16:13.129
Like, I got the rights to
become a Selector again.

16:13.130 --> 16:14.739
Why don't you say hi?

16:14.740 --> 16:19.239
Hi there, I'm Milulun!
Pleased to meet you-lunlun!

16:19.240 --> 16:24.840
W-Wait... Why do you want to battle again?

16:26.250 --> 16:26.910
Huh?

16:26.911 --> 16:32.019
Aki-lucky is unlucky now...

16:32.020 --> 16:37.059
Even if I can hide my scar with makeup,
I can't make it go away.

16:37.060 --> 16:40.189
Secretly hiding it for
the rest of my life is just...

16:40.190 --> 16:43.399
Poor, Akira. Sobby-sobby...

16:43.400 --> 16:44.060
W-Well...

16:44.061 --> 16:50.739
But, if Ru-ru can battle me,
I feel like I can do my best again!

16:50.740 --> 16:54.370
Please, Ru-ru. Battle me!

17:03.450 --> 17:05.219
Okay.

17:05.220 --> 17:06.419
Yay!

17:06.420 --> 17:08.619
Aki-lucky!

17:08.620 --> 17:13.229
I don't know Iona, or
Akira-<i>san</i>'s intentions...

17:13.230 --> 17:14.250
But...

17:15.560 --> 17:16.960
Open!

17:29.810 --> 17:33.879
Hey... looks like you're a real LRIG now...

17:33.880 --> 17:36.249
Iona-<i>chan...</i>

17:36.250 --> 17:42.380
Wanted to be an LRIG, eh?
Twisted, aren't you?

17:45.060 --> 17:50.829
Let Aki-lucky teach a pervy
girl like you a thing or two!

17:50.830 --> 17:52.890
Milulun, Grow!

17:57.070 --> 17:59.269
Is Ruko going to be okay?

17:59.270 --> 18:00.110
Hm?

18:00.111 --> 18:04.649
You know how reckless Akira
is when it comes to battles?

18:04.650 --> 18:08.340
If there's a battle, without Tama...

18:09.820 --> 18:13.589
I wonder what kind of girl Tama was like?

18:13.590 --> 18:14.819
What?

18:14.820 --> 18:19.089
Before turning into an LRIG,
Tama was like any other girl, right?

18:19.090 --> 18:22.099
Oh, yeah... Right...

18:22.100 --> 18:24.259
Kind of hard to imagine.

18:24.260 --> 18:27.199
At first, she was like just
saying "nyaah," and stuff.

18:27.200 --> 18:29.039
Maybe she was a cat.

18:29.040 --> 18:33.139
But... she is Ruko's precious friend.

18:33.140 --> 18:35.109
Yeah...

18:35.110 --> 18:36.670
Precious...

18:39.810 --> 18:42.679
So weak...!

18:42.680 --> 18:43.949
Summon, Babel!

18:43.950 --> 18:46.449
Ruko... are you serious?

18:46.450 --> 18:47.819
Iona...?

18:47.820 --> 18:50.789
My ability forces the opponent to attack.

18:50.790 --> 18:56.459
In this turn, it makes strategic sense
to summon a high-powered SIGNI.

18:56.460 --> 18:58.569
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

18:58.570 --> 19:01.800
Why the heck is an LRIG giving orders?!

19:04.840 --> 19:08.009
I'm... not serious...?

19:08.010 --> 19:09.879
No, that's not it...

19:09.880 --> 19:13.809
I'm trying to be serious...

19:13.810 --> 19:14.720
But...!

19:14.721 --> 19:16.680
Ruuuu!

19:17.680 --> 19:21.359
Spell! Slash Miracle!

19:21.360 --> 19:24.859
Here comes a spell! Milulun! Anti-Spell!

19:24.860 --> 19:27.230
Miiiilulun!

19:30.000 --> 19:31.230
Iona!

19:41.840 --> 19:43.579
Hey!

19:43.580 --> 19:47.749
You girls! Didn't you see the
sign that said "Do Not Enter"?

19:47.750 --> 19:49.349
Now hurry and get out of here!

19:49.350 --> 19:51.949
I-I'm sorry!

19:51.950 --> 19:53.749
Aww...

19:53.750 --> 19:57.189
Interrupted in the
middle of battle again...

19:57.190 --> 19:59.059
Too bad!

19:59.060 --> 20:00.589
Akira-<i>san...</i>

20:00.590 --> 20:02.099
Iona...?

20:02.100 --> 20:03.759
Super pathetic, right?

20:03.760 --> 20:05.929
After all you went through to be an LRIG,

20:05.930 --> 20:09.699
you end up being stuck with
a wimpy Selector like her...

20:09.700 --> 20:12.869
You think you can get
away with just one battle?

20:12.870 --> 20:18.310
I'll just keep coming back over and
over again to make life miserable...

20:19.380 --> 20:23.419
for the both of you.

20:23.420 --> 20:25.720
Bye-bye-lun!

20:28.820 --> 20:29.959
Ruko?

20:29.960 --> 20:31.089
Serious...!

20:31.090 --> 20:32.229
What...?

20:32.230 --> 20:35.229
It's... not that I wasn't serious!

20:35.230 --> 20:36.899
But...!

20:36.900 --> 20:39.469
But, it isn't fun...

20:39.470 --> 20:44.670
I'm not with friends or
with Tama, so this isn't fun!

20:46.110 --> 20:47.730
Friends...

20:51.310 --> 20:52.809
Yippieeee!

20:52.810 --> 20:57.419
So, what they were saying was true then!

20:57.420 --> 21:01.819
Well, I was kind of worried whether
I should have told you or not.

21:01.820 --> 21:05.259
There is this thing about
confidentiality, you know?

21:05.260 --> 21:07.429
Wow! What should I do? What should I do?

21:07.430 --> 21:11.269
Say, Eldora? If I become a
card, can I choose what I'll wear?!

21:11.270 --> 21:13.829
Chiyori's gonna definitely
choose something all in pink!

21:13.830 --> 21:15.999
And... mint-green is cool, too!

21:16.000 --> 21:17.639
Thought you said "definitely"...

21:17.640 --> 21:21.509
Chiyori! "That's Moonlight Chorizo!"

21:21.510 --> 21:22.140
Huh...?

21:22.141 --> 21:25.449
Heheh! Chiyori's special move, number one!

21:25.450 --> 21:28.649
Ah, well a chorizo is like a sausage,

21:28.650 --> 21:31.849
and I thought that "chori"
sounds like "Chiyori."

21:31.850 --> 21:35.059
Thank goodness I'm Chiyori's LRIG.

21:35.060 --> 21:38.859
I don't have to feel guilty with you.

21:38.860 --> 21:41.329
Heheheh! Chori-tto!

21:41.330 --> 21:42.729
May I...?

21:42.730 --> 21:44.060
Huh?

21:45.670 --> 21:47.900
I-Iona...?

21:52.410 --> 21:55.840
"That Feverish Bond"

22:02.220 --> 22:03.819
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.820 --> 22:09.219
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.220 --> 22:13.829
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.830 --> 22:15.399
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.400 --> 22:21.029
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:21.030 --> 22:25.739
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.740 --> 22:31.209
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.210 --> 22:37.379
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.380 --> 22:42.459
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.460 --> 22:50.460
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.270 --> 22:59.309
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.310 --> 23:06.049
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:06.050 --> 23:11.079
<i>Release myself towards
the future I selected</i>

23:11.080 --> 23:13.719
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.720 --> 23:20.790
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:28.139
I like Tama...

23:28.140 --> 23:29.599
Because Tama is gone?

23:29.600 --> 23:30.839
It's because Tama was with me...

23:30.840 --> 23:33.069
Using me as a clue to find Tama is a lie.

23:33.070 --> 23:34.739
I liked battling alongside Tama...

23:34.740 --> 23:36.979
You don't know anything. Even about Tama...

23:36.980 --> 23:38.650
I... want to meet Tama!

23:38.650 --> 23:40.810
That Accidental Reunion.

23:38.651 --> 23:40.910
"That Accidental Reunion"
